This work was produced as an exercise in testing whether AI agents can run a bioinformatics research
project. A lead AI agent (the 'PI', Claude Opus 5.5) directed sub-agents (Claude Opus 5.5 and Sonnet 5.5)
under a human-written brief. The human researcher supplied the brief, the data and PhosphoSitePlus access;
they did not write the code, run the analyses, or write the text. All results should be checked before use.

